WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:02.035
- YO, YO, YO, WHAT UP,
WHAT UP, WHAT UP?

00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:03.536
WELCOME TO<i> BATTLE RAP,</i>
WHERE WE'RE GONNA BATTLE RAP

00:00:03.569 --> 00:00:05.438
EVERY DAY IN THE MONTH OF
FEBRUARY, Y'ALL.

00:00:05.471 --> 00:00:07.306
YO, I'M YOUR HOST,
BIG PEEP-PAROO!

00:00:07.339 --> 00:00:08.841
all: R-R-R-ROO!
- THAT'S RIGHT, THAT'S RIGHT,

00:00:08.874 --> 00:00:10.910
THAT'S RIGHT, THAT'S RIGHT.
TO MY LEFT, WE GOT THE CHAMPION.

00:00:10.943 --> 00:00:12.545
YO, INTRODUCE, SON!
- YEAH, WHAT'S HAPPENIN'?

00:00:12.578 --> 00:00:15.314
THIS YOUR BOY, RHINO D,
AND I'M ABOUT TO FRONTHAND...

00:00:15.347 --> 00:00:16.883
BACKHAND HIS ASS
OFF THE MIC!

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:18.317
- THAT'S RIGHT, THAT'S RIGHT,
THAT'S RIGHT.

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:19.819
AND ON MY RIGHT,
WE GOT THE CHALLENGER.

00:00:19.852 --> 00:00:21.087
INTRODUCE YOURSELF, PLAYA.
- YEAH, WHAT'S UP, MAN?

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.522
I'M DILLER KILLER,
IN THE HOUSE.

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:25.491
100 USDA PURE MEAT.
NO FILLER RIGHT HERE, DAWG.

00:00:25.524 --> 00:00:27.427
- HOO! HOO! [barks]
- OKAY, OKAY.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:29.228
YO, DILLER LOST THE TOSS,
SO YOU GO FIRST.

00:00:29.261 --> 00:00:30.930
OKAY, GENTLEMEN,
BATTLE RAP!

00:00:30.963 --> 00:00:32.298
- ALL RIGHT, YEAH.
NOW, HERE WE GO.

00:00:32.331 --> 00:00:34.300
YOU'RE SHOOK, SON.
I'M GONNA EAT YOU FOR BREAKFAST.

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:35.701
'CAUSE I'M A COOK, SON.
- HA HA!

00:00:35.734 --> 00:00:38.137
I STOLE A COP-A-FEEL
FROM YOUR GIRL'S BREASTESES!

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:39.338
- YEAH, YEAH, YEAH.

00:00:39.371 --> 00:00:41.040
- [high-pitched growling]

00:00:41.073 --> 00:00:42.508
- WAIT A MINUTE.
GET BACK.

00:00:42.541 --> 00:00:44.310
- [growling continues]

00:00:44.343 --> 00:00:45.745
- HE DON'T EVEN KNOW, MAN.
HEY, LISTEN, MAN.

00:00:45.778 --> 00:00:48.214
YOU CAN'T EVEN WIN
THIS 100-YARD DASH,

00:00:48.247 --> 00:00:49.582
BUT LET ME ASK YOU
A QUESTION.

00:00:49.615 --> 00:00:51.951
WHAT DO THEY CALL THAT,
A MOUSTACHE?

00:00:51.984 --> 00:00:54.053
all: OHH...

00:00:54.086 --> 00:00:56.089
- [growling]

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:57.790
AAAAH!

00:00:57.823 --> 00:00:59.459
AAH!
- NO, MAN, SEE--

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:02.228
RELAX, MAN. HEY, I NEED YOU
TO RELAX A LITTLE BIT.

00:01:02.261 --> 00:01:03.329
- [growling]

00:01:03.362 --> 00:01:04.764
- TAKE IT DOWN
A LITTLE BIT.

00:01:04.797 --> 00:01:06.899
- AHHHHHH...
- WHAT THE [bleep] YOU DOIN'?

00:01:06.932 --> 00:01:09.902
I'M TELLING YOU, TAKE--CAN YOU
TAKE IT DOWN A LITTLE BIT, MAN?

00:01:09.935 --> 00:01:11.370
- [growls quieter]

00:01:11.403 --> 00:01:13.639
- COME ON, WHAT ARE YOU,
A HORSE? LIKE...

00:01:13.672 --> 00:01:17.443
- AAAAH!
- THAT'S THE LAST ONE.

00:01:17.476 --> 00:01:19.078
YO, WHAT'S UP, DAWG?
YOU KNOW, MY [bleep] IS RICH.

00:01:19.111 --> 00:01:20.546
I'M SWIMMIN' IN SIMOLEONS.

00:01:20.579 --> 00:01:22.982
WHAT AM I SUPPOSED TO DO WITH
THIS MINIATURE BLACK NAPOLEON?

00:01:23.015 --> 00:01:24.784
- [growling]

00:01:24.817 --> 00:01:26.185
- YEAH, ALL RIGHT.

00:01:26.218 --> 00:01:27.720
YO! HEY, MAN.

00:01:27.753 --> 00:01:29.856
HEY, DAWG,
GET YOUR--HEY, HEY!

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:32.125
NOW--COME ON, NOW.
DON'T GET MY EYES WET.

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:33.392
HEY, HEY, GET YOUR BOY--

00:01:33.425 --> 00:01:35.394
- WAAAAAAH!
- YO, I'M SORRY.

00:01:35.427 --> 00:01:36.829
LOOK AT THAT. LOOK AT THIS.
LOOK AT THIS.

00:01:36.862 --> 00:01:39.198
LOOK AT IT. LOOK AT IT.
OH, OH, YEAH.

00:01:39.231 --> 00:01:40.967
GO GET IT, NOW.
THAT'S A BOY. OH.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.969
YEAH, MAN! HERE WE GO!
YEAH, MAN, LOOK AT THAT CHAIN

00:01:43.002 --> 00:01:44.871
AND THESE FAKE-ASS
TIMBERLANDS.

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:46.739
- AAAAAAHHH...
- OH, MAN!

00:01:46.772 --> 00:01:48.875
- I'M SORRY.
NO, YOU'RE OKAY, MAN.

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:50.843
I'M SORRY.
I REALLY APOLOGIZE.

00:01:50.876 --> 00:01:52.178
- YO, MAN.
WHAT'S WRONG WITH HIM, MAN?

00:01:52.211 --> 00:01:53.846
- HEY, HEY!
REMEMBER--NO, NO, HEY!

00:01:53.879 --> 00:01:57.817
- AAAAAAHHH...

00:01:57.850 --> 00:01:59.752
AHH AHH!
- WHY ARE YOU DOING ME?

00:01:59.785 --> 00:02:01.154
- AAAAAHH!
- WHY WOULD YOU--LISTEN.

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:04.390
- AAAAH!
- NO. NO, NO, NO. COME ON.

00:02:04.423 --> 00:02:07.860
- AAAAHH!
- SHH. SHH. SHH.

00:02:07.893 --> 00:02:09.128
- ALL RIGHT,
YOU GUYS GOTTA GO, MAN.

00:02:09.161 --> 00:02:10.563
- NO, COME ON, MAN.
- NO, MAN.

00:02:10.596 --> 00:02:13.065
NO, YOU'RE ALL DONE, MAN.
YOU GOT TO GO.

00:02:13.098 --> 00:02:14.667
THAT'S RIGHT, MAN.
YO, WE GOT A CHAMPION STILL.

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:15.835
WE GOT A CHAMPION STILL
RIGHT HERE.

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:17.203
- HEY, WHAT'S HAPPENIN'?

00:02:17.236 --> 00:02:19.305
YEAH! THAT'S WHAT'S UP.
THAT'S YOUR BOY--

00:02:19.338 --> 00:02:20.907
- AAAAAAHH...
- JUST...GIVE ME THE HAT!

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:22.008
- HEY, MAN--
- GIVE IT UP!

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:23.910
[indistinct shouting]

00:02:23.943 --> 00:02:25.011
GIMME THAT [bleep] HAT!

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:27.013
[birds chirping]

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:29.048
- [sustained gibberish]

00:02:29.081 --> 00:02:31.217
- LISTEN.
LISTEN--LISTEN, MAN.

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:33.452
I WANT YOU TO LOOK OUT
ON THE LAKE, MAN.

00:02:33.485 --> 00:02:36.122
I JUST WANT YOU TO LOOK OUT
AND IMAGINE A PLACE, MAN,

00:02:36.155 --> 00:02:37.290
WHERE YOU CAN DO
YOUR THING, MAN.

00:02:37.323 --> 00:02:38.624
- HOOOOO...

00:02:38.657 --> 00:02:40.126
- WHERE YOU AND I COULD GO
AND DO OUR THING,

00:02:40.159 --> 00:02:43.162
BUT NEVER HAVE TO FORFEIT, YEAH!
- YAHH.

00:02:43.195 --> 00:02:44.530
- YOU COULD SCREAM AND SHOUT
AND SHOVE PEOPLE

00:02:44.563 --> 00:02:46.666
BACK AND FORTH, BUT WE DON'T
NEVER HAVE TO QUIT.

00:02:46.699 --> 00:02:48.267
- AAAAH!
- BUT LOOK OUT ON THE LAKE, MAN.

00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:50.369
LOOK OUT ON THE LAKE.

00:02:50.402 --> 00:02:52.672
NO MATTER WHAT HAPPENS, MAN,
I START RAPPIN'.

00:02:52.705 --> 00:02:53.673
- HWAH!

00:02:53.706 --> 00:02:55.174
- AND MY RHYMES,
THEY START TO FLOW.

00:02:55.207 --> 00:02:57.043
AND I'M TURNIN' THE TIDE.

00:02:57.076 --> 00:02:59.111
AND NO MATTER WHAT YOU DO,
YOU CAN PUSH AND SHOVE

00:02:59.144 --> 00:03:01.380
AND SCREAM, BUT WE'LL NEVER
GET DISQUALIFIED.

00:03:01.413 --> 00:03:03.115
- LAA LAA LAA!

00:03:03.148 --> 00:03:04.617
AH HA HA HA!

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:08.020
YEAH, YEAH, OOH! HA-HA!

00:03:08.053 --> 00:03:09.956
- MAN, FOR GOOD MEASURE, WHILE
YOU'RE LOOKING AT THE LAKE,

00:03:09.989 --> 00:03:12.024
JUST GIVE ME
ONE MORE GOOD "AAAAHH."

00:03:12.057 --> 00:03:13.226
- AAAAH--

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:15.495
[gunshot]

